  "disclaimer": "*This % may represent an aggregate of THC/CBD, THCa/CBDa, THCb/CBDb within the product. Consumers should review the actual product label for exact % of THC/CBD.",
  "description": "Tower Three brings you the legendary OG Kush in a convenient 1g pre-roll format, perfect for cannabis enthusiasts seeking a classic experience. This premium preroll showcases one of the most iconic strains in cannabis history, celebrated for its complex flavor profile and well-balanced effects. OG Kush delivers a distinctive blend of earthy, pine, and woody aromas with hints of fuel and spice that seasoned connoisseurs have cherished for decades. Whether you're unwinding after a long day or enjoying time with friends, this ready-to-smoke preroll offers relaxing and euphoric effects that promote happiness and stress relief. The 1g size provides an ideal single-session experience without waste. Tower Three's commitment to quality ensures consistent potency and smooth smoke in every preroll. Simply light up and enjoy the timeless appeal of OG Kush—no grinding or rolling required.",
